      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Luttrell%2C_Tennessee"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Tennessee State Route 131 and State Route 61 intersect in Luttrell, connecting it to Plainview, Maynardville, and Blaine.",
